+| AC-013 | AC-006, AC-021 | Specifically bounded same-Run approved UR-at-SD revision, exact historical preservation, invalidation/reassessment/renewed decisions, transport parity and interruption/conflict/replay protection. |
+
+## Product and design boundaries
+
+The former app-button exclusion is removed only for the explicitly approved focused card. The general cockpit remains a read consumer with existing draft checks. The supported revision extension is exactly the early UR-at-SD boundary; other lifecycle cases do not acquire permission. The already implemented separate Core bootstrap is a reusable prerequisite whose integrated transport/decision chain still needs qualification.
+
+The before_prd decisions resolve the user's coherent scope, equal text route, single deliberate decision, distinct permission, truthful evidence and required actual native acceptance. Operation schemas, actual human-origin transport, request/reject recording owner, deduplication/correlation, compatibility and recovery remain explicit later_sd technical obligations. Exact scenarios and observation preparation remain later_tp. Neither a missing host implementation nor a technical detail is presented as a user decision already made beyond the approved UR.
+
+The existing AC-001 through AC-015 identities are retained; AC-016 through AC-021 add the renewed outcomes. The German summary covers each of 21 criteria exactly once, with separate goal/scope/decision context and no omitted decision-relevant content. Existing read-only MCP authoring checks passed at revision 15, 3a7feb40-4d24-4228-a239-04cd7c2fc9e4, with no open PRD decision. That check does not establish source registration, approval or implementation.
+
+## Recording
+
+PRD_MAPPING_02.json is the cooperative reviewed input for the exact UR-derived_from relationship through the existing writer. Initial registration for this renewed source uses update_draft false because the previous active relationship was invalidated by canonical source revision; its proof files are retained. The writer must revalidate target/revision/source/destination under its locks and create its own receipt. A fresh presentation and new deliberate Approval: PRD are required afterward.
